   "start": 2.28,
   "end": 7.3,
   "text": "Somebody drew the Grim Reaper on the gate around a drilling floor in Midland, Texas. Behind it",
   "source": "measured_boundary"
  },
  {
   "id": "c2",
   "start": 8.2,
   "end": 13.02,
   "text": "is the square of steel where about a third of significant drilling injuries happen. The pipe",
   "source": "measured_boundary"
  },
  {
   "id": "c3",
   "start": 14.1,
   "end": 16.44,
   "text": "crossing that floor weighs roughly two thousand pounds.",
   "source": "measured_boundary"
  },
  {
   "id": "c4",
   "start": 16.64,
   "end": 21.5,
   "text": "A contractor sits in a small office on the rig, operating robotic",
   "source": "measured_boundary"
  },
  {
   "id": "c5",
   "start": 21.66,
   "end": 28.02,
   "text": "machinery from a screen. Exxon runs more than thirty rigs in the Permian. Two of them are",
   "source": "measured_boundary"
  },
  {
   "id": "c6",
   "start": 28.92,
   "end": 30.14,
   "text": "automated. The drilling",
   "source": "measured_boundary"
  },
  {
   "id": "c7",
   "start": 31.38,
   "end": 37.1,
   "text": "contractor that supplied one of those two told investors what it expected a robotic rig to do. Their own",
   "source": "measured_boundary"
  },
  {
   "id": "c8",
   "start": 38.38,
   "end": 44.36,
   "text": "people. At least as well as what our people are performing. Past the fence,",
   "source": "measured_boundary"
  },
  {
   "id": "c9",
   "start": 44.5,
   "end": 51.56,
   "text": "most producers the Dallas Fed asked expect artificial intelligence to take nothing off their break even price for new wells.",
   "source": "measured_boundary"
